# Working research dossiers. Kept on disk for preparing the talk, deliberately
# NOT committed: they quote SSH host aliases, project account codes, usernames,
# job IDs and scheduler captures that include other people's jobs.
/notes/research/

# Speaker's own preparation notes. Kept on disk, deliberately NOT committed: they
# record what to verify before the day, which claims were cut and why, and the
# lines to say aloud. None of that belongs in a public repository.
/notes/speaker-checklist.md
